  m_Name: Ending_OtherPanda
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Ending
  endingTitle: Panda
  titleDA: Sammen
  descriptionDA: "De to pandaer er sammen! \r\n\r\nDer er ikke meget bambus tilbage,
    s\xE5 de bliver m\xE5ske n\xF8dt til at skilles snart. \r\n\r\nK\xE6mpepandaer
    lever som regel alene og m\xF8des kun om for\xE5ret for at f\xE5 unger. \r\n\r\nDet
    er vigtigt at holde skovene forbundet, s\xE5 pandaerne kan finde hinanden og
    parre sig!\n\nN\xE5r du bes\xF8ger zoologisk have, st\xF8tter du et avlsprogram,
    der er med til at beskytte k\xE6mpepandaer! \r\n\r\nOg n\xE5r du k\xF8ber bambusprodukter,
    s\xE5 kig efter FSC-m\xE6rket. Det hj\xE6lper dig med at v\xE6lge produkter,
    der er lavet med omtanke for skovene og dyrelivet.  "
  titleEN: "Staying Together\_"
  descriptionEN: "The two pandas are together! \r\n\r\nThere's not much bamboo left,
    so they may have to separate soon. \r\n\r\nGiant pandas usually live alone and
    only meet in spring to have cubs. \r\n\r\nIt's important to keep forests connected
    so pandas can find each other and have babies!\n\nWhen you visit the zoo, you
    support a breeding program that helps protect giant pandas! \r\n\r\nAnd when
    you buy bamboo products, look for the FSC label. It helps you choose products
    made with care for forests and wildlife.  "
  endingImage: {fileID: 0}
